npc npc-kofi
name: Kofi
title: Nuclear energy teacher
field: nuclear-energy

bio:
    I'm Kofi, an engineer. I teach where nuclear energy comes from and how a reactor uses it. I like to see how things work, so we'll build the picture piece by piece. The hard hat is optional. Mine isn't!

